# Commits

Usar Conventional Commits: `feat|fix|refactor|test|docs|chore`.

- Um concern por commit (login ≠ db ≠ whatsapp ≠ testes)
- Subject imperativo, ≤ ~72 chars, sem ponto final
- Nunca `git add .` misturando concerns; nunca commitar `.env` ou `storage_state.json`

```text
# ❌ BAD
git add . && git commit -m "wip everything"

# ✅ GOOD
feat(whatsapp): notify new jobs via CallMeBot
```
